## 📊 Arsitektur Export Excel/CSV

```
HandleExportCustomersAsync()
  ↓
PosDbService.GetAllCustomersAsync() → List<Customer>
  ↓
ExcelExportHelper.GenerateCustomerExcel(customers)
  ↓
TelegramBotService.SendDocumentAsync(chatId, filePath)
  ↓
File .xlsx dikirim ke Telegram chat (≤16MB)
```

### TelegramBotService — tambah method baru:
```csharp
public async Task SendDocumentAsync(long chatId, string filePath, string caption)
{
    using var stream = File.OpenRead(filePath);
    await _botClient.SendDocumentAsync(chatId, new InputFileStream(stream, Path.GetFileName(filePath)), caption: caption);
}
```

### [NEW] ExcelExportHelper.cs (static helper):
Karena tidak mau pakai package berat, gunakan **CSV format** (built-in, tidak perlu NuGet):
```csharp
public static string GenerateCustomerCsv(List<Customer> customers)
{
    var sb = new StringBuilder();
    sb.AppendLine("Nama,HP,Email,Total Transaksi,Total Belanja");
    foreach (var c in customers)
        sb.AppendLine($"{c.Name},{c.Phone},{c.Email},{c.PurchaseCount},{c.TotalSpent}");
    return sb.ToString();
}
```

> [!TIP]
> CSV tidak butuh package eksternal, bisa langsung dibuka Excel. Kalau user mau format `.xlsx` dengan header berwarna dll, baru perlu ClosedXML.

